# Routing

Order:

1. `vercel.json` redirects
2. `next.config.ts` redirects/rewrites
3. Next.js App Router
4. Static files in `public/`

Static HTML in `public/` must use absolute paths.

- Use `/proposal-bootcamp/2-upsell.html`
- Do not use `2-upsell.html` (breaks without a trailing slash)

`govcongiants.org` and www hosts 308 to `govcongiants.com`. Do not remove those redirects. Libsyn already shipped `.org` links.

Do not describe `/bootcamp`, `/free-course`, or `/proposal-bootcamp` as live funnels without reading `vercel.json`. `/opp` is defined in `next.config.ts` (currently `getmindy.ai/opportunity-hunter`).
